	light="/images/docs_cleanup[style=light].png"
	dark="/images/docs_cleanup[style=dark].png"
	alt="The Settings tab for the Movies Test instance, with Cleanup enabled, a weekly Sunday midnight schedule, and a Run Now button."
	border />

## Scheduling

Cleanup defaults to Sunday at midnight. You can change its [schedule](/monitoring/jobs#scheduling) in the instance's **Settings** tab. Scheduled runs scan and delete automatically, without asking you to confirm a preview.
